# Hunk

Qt 6 side-by-side git diff with review comments copied as `path:line` or `path:first-last` markdown.

## Layout

- `src/main.cpp` — process entry
- `src/MacIcon.mm` / `MacIcon.hpp` — Dock, app-switcher, and About icon on macOS
- `icons/` — app icon for the macOS bundle and the Linux menu
- `src/Smoke.cpp` / `Smoke.hpp` — offscreen `--smoke` check
- `src/MainWindow.cpp` / `MainWindow.hpp` — window lifecycle
- `src/MainActions.cpp` / `BarIcon.cpp` — menus, toolbar, and button icons
- `src/MainRecent.cpp` — File menu recent repositories
- `src/MainChrome.cpp` — splitter, review dock, and wiring
- `src/MainAbout.cpp` — About dialog
- `src/MainFilePane.cpp` — file list, name filter, content search, the totals bar, and copying a file's relative path
- `src/MainTree.cpp` — folder tree
- `src/MainHide.cpp` — hide a reviewed file until it changes, and show it again
- `src/MainSeen.cpp` / `MainSeen.hpp` / `MainHeat.cpp` — files and lines changed since review, and files hidden until they change
- `src/MainFileRow.cpp` — file-list added and removed counts, and the reviewed check
- `src/MainNotes.cpp` / `MainNoteList.cpp` / `MainNoteKeep.cpp` — review list, double-click jumps to the line, per-line delete, and which comment stays selected
- `src/MainReview.cpp` — comment and copy
- `src/MainLoad.cpp` — git result applied to the window
- `src/MainPath.cpp` — project path on the toolbar
- `src/MainRef.cpp` / `MainRef.hpp` — mode, base, and branch dropdowns
- `src/MainRefFilter.cpp` — typing in a base or branch field lists matching branches under it
- `src/MainWatch.cpp` — quiet reload on focus and when watched paths change
- `src/MainDisk.cpp` / `MainDiskWalk.cpp` — filesystem watch for the worktree and git refs
- `src/MainDetail.hpp` — theme and note label
- `src/Theme.cpp` — system, dark, and light palettes
- `src/MainTheme.cpp` — theme menu and live system theme
- `src/DiffCanvas.cpp` / `DiffCanvas.hpp` — diff view state
- `src/MdView.cpp` / `MdView.hpp` / `MdChrome.cpp` / `MdRead.cpp` / `MdHtml.cpp` / `third_party/markdown/` — GitHub markdown preview, and the switch back to the diff
- `src/DiffScroll.cpp` — scroll and sticky file tracking
- `src/DiffInput.cpp` / `DiffTitle.cpp` — gutter clicks, and the reviewed check on the file title
- `src/DiffSplit.cpp` — drag the border between panes
- `src/DiffSelect.cpp` — drag to select text and the copy menu
- `src/DiffMark.cpp` — word selection and the copied text
- `src/DiffHeader.cpp` — file header and labels
- `src/DiffPaint.cpp` — row paint
- `src/DiffSide.cpp` — one pane, word highlights, search highlights, selected text
- `src/DiffSyntax.cpp` / `DiffSyntax.hpp` — paint syntax colors
- `src/Syntax.hpp` / `SyntaxRule.hpp` / `SyntaxLang.cpp` / `SyntaxScan.cpp` / `SyntaxText.cpp` / `SyntaxWord.cpp` / `SyntaxMd.cpp` / `SyntaxEmph.cpp` — language tokens
- `src/DiffColors.cpp` / `DiffColors.hpp` — diff colors and the reviewed check
- `src/DiffDoc.cpp` / `DiffDoc.hpp` — file and row model
- `src/DiffParse.cpp` / `DiffParse.hpp` — unified diff walk
- `src/DiffGap.cpp` — unchanged lines the diff skipped
- `src/DiffPath.cpp` / `DiffDetail.hpp` — paths and headers
- `src/WordDiff.cpp` — word highlights
- `src/DiffZip.cpp` — paired delete and add lines
- `src/DiffFold.cpp` / `DiffFold.hpp` — which unchanged lines collapse
- `src/DiffFoldView.cpp` — fold bar paint and clicks; a search match opens that fold
- `src/DiffLayout.cpp` — per-file line wrap cache and band relayout
- `src/GitRepo.cpp` / `GitRepo.hpp` / `GitRename.cpp` — background git load; a staged rename stays one file
- `src/GitBlob.cpp` — file text for each side of a diff
- `src/GitCmd.cpp` / `GitDetail.hpp` — git process, base and branch refs
- `src/GitStamp.cpp` — head, worktree status, resolved base, and ignored directories
- `src/GitDrift.cpp` — whether local main or master is ahead or behind origin
- `src/GitRef.cpp` — mtime of refs and packed-refs
- `src/GitRange.cpp` — merge-request range
- `src/GitPoint.cpp` / `GitFork.cpp` — branching point: the branch this work was cut from, or `branch^` / `branch~N`
- `src/ReviewStore.cpp` / `ReviewStore.hpp` / `ReviewSync.cpp` — comments in QSettings, and keeping them when lines move
- `src/ReviewShift.cpp` / `ReviewShift.hpp` / `ReviewSpan.cpp` / `ReviewMatch.hpp` — moved comment line or span
- `src/ReviewNote.hpp` — one comment
- `src/ReviewExport.cpp` / `ReviewExport.hpp` — agent markdown
- `tests/parse_test.cpp` / `file_test.cpp` / `fold_test.cpp` / `gap_test.cpp` / `review_test.cpp` / `shift_test.cpp` — parser, fold, gap, and review checks
- `tests/syntax_test.cpp` / `md_test.cpp` / `emph_test.cpp` — syntax color checks
- `CMakeLists.txt` — Qt 6 Widgets app and test
- `README.md` — build and review format
- `LICENSE` — MIT license, Copyright © 2026 Peter Adrianov
- `features/*.feature` — Gherkin UX reference
- `.cursor/rules/gherkin-features.mdc` — keep those scenarios current
